# CMS22 Terminology

library "CMS22 Terminology".

// Migrated to CRL v0.7: `concept` is the only declaration kind; `definition is` body for narrative predicates;
// concept `defined as` body is bare ref or sem-or/sem-and/sem-not composition.
// All multi-clause concepts now compose named inferences via sem-* operators.


// ============ Terminologies (valuesets) ============
// Real valuesets from the source CMS22 CQL library with VSAC URLs.

terminology "Diagnosis of Hypertension":
- valueset is `http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113883.3.600.263`.

terminology "Dietary Recommendations":
- valueset is `http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113883.3.600.1515`.

