- valueset is `http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113883.3.600.1920`.

terminology "Finding of Elevated Blood Pressure or Hypertension":
- valueset is `http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113762.1.4.1047.514`.

terminology "Follow Up Within 4 Weeks":
- valueset is `http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113883.3.526.3.1578`.

