terminology "Patient Declined":
- valueset is `http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113883.3.526.3.1582`.

terminology "Pharmacologic Therapy for Hypertension":
- valueset is `http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113883.3.526.1577`.

terminology "Recommendation to Increase Physical Activity":
- valueset is `http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113883.3.600.1518`.

terminology "Referral or Counseling for Alcohol Consumption":
