// Single-code terminologies — source CQL uses these as LOINC/ActCode codes
// (not valuesets). Now declared as proper system+code terminologies with
// the actual codes from the source CQL.

terminology "Blood pressure panel with all children optional":
- system is `http://loinc.org`.
- code is `85354-9`.

terminology "Systolic Blood Pressure Code":
- system is `http://loinc.org`.
- code is `8480-6`.

terminology "Diastolic Blood Pressure Code":
- system is `http://loinc.org`.
- code is `8462-4`.

terminology "EKG 12 Lead Panel Code":
- system is `http://loinc.org`.
- code is `34534-8`.

terminology "EKG Study Code":
- system is `http://loinc.org`.
- code is `11524-6`.

terminology "Virtual Encounter Class":
- system is `http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActCode`.
- code is `VR`.

